# ReachInbox Email Scheduler

A production-style email scheduling service and dashboard. Emails are scheduled through an API, held as **BullMQ delayed jobs on Redis**, and delivered through **Ethereal SMTP** by one or more workers. There are **no cron jobs** anywhere. The service survives restarts without losing or duplicating emails.

![TypeScript](https://img.shields.io/badge/TypeScript-5-blue) ![Express](https://img.shields.io/badge/Express-4-black) ![BullMQ](https://img.shields.io/badge/BullMQ-Redis-red) ![Postgres](https://img.shields.io/badge/PostgreSQL-16-336791) ![React](https://img.shields.io/badge/React-18-61dafb) ![Tailwind](https://img.shields.io/badge/Tailwind-4-38bdf8)

